{
  "scene_id": "act5_scene3_epilogue",
  "start": "n1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/roof/night1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 1.5,
      "next": "n2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_music",
      "track": "assets/music/my_little_world.ogg",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 2.0,
      "next": "n3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The rooftop again. Nighttime. The stars are out in full, and the city glows faintly on the horizon.",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The performance is over. The audience has gone home. But I'm not ready to leave yet.",
      "next": "n5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The door opens behind me. I already know who it is before I turn around.",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "tiffany_rot >= 7",
      "trueNode": "n_broken_harmony_start",
      "falseNode": "n7_check_hanami"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7_check_hanami",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "hanami_rot >= 5",
      "trueNode": "n_fading_notes_start",
      "falseNode": "n8_check_best"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8_check_best",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "cassian_trust >= 5",
      "trueNode": "n_new_harmony_start",
      "falseNode": "n_echoes_start"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_broken_harmony_start",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_bh2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "glitch",
      "intensity": 2.5,
      "duration": 0.6,
      "next": "n_bh3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "text": "I couldn't hold it together... I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...",
      "text_effect": "glitch",
      "effect_intensity": 3.0,
      "next": "n_bh4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh4",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She's shaking. The performance took everything she had left, and there's nothing remaining.",
      "next": "n_bh5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Tiffany—",
      "next": "n_bh6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "text": "I kept telling myself... if I just held on a little longer... if the music was perfect enough... but I broke. I broke and I can't put myself back together.",
      "text_effect": "glitch",
      "effect_intensity": 2.0,
      "next": "n_bh7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh7",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "shake_screen",
      "intensity": 2,
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh8",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh10",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "crying",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh11",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The others arrive. They see her. No one needs an explanation.",
      "next": "n_bh12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Hey. Tiffany. Listen to me. You don't have to be perfect. You never had to be.",
      "next": "n_bh13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh13",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "We're going to help you. Okay? You helped all of us, and now it's our turn.",
      "next": "n_bh14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh14",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "text": "The music was haunting tonight. Beautiful and broken, just like us. And that's okay.",
      "next": "n_bh15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The performance was haunting. The kind of beauty that comes from things falling apart. The audience felt it too — that rawness, that desperate honesty.",
      "next": "n_bh16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh16",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The club ends tonight. But the others make a promise — to each other, to Tiffany — that this isn't the end of them.",
      "next": "n_bh17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh17",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Some music is born from pain. And sometimes, the most broken songs are the ones that stay with you the longest.",
      "next": "n_bh18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh18",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh19",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh20"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh20",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh21"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh21",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ending_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fading_notes_start",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_fn2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "text": "It was beautiful tonight, wasn't it?",
      "next": "n_fn3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "It was. You were amazing, Hanami.",
      "next": "n_fn4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn4",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "text": "I need to tell you something. My doctor says... I need to step back. From music. From a lot of things.",
      "next": "n_fn5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Hanami...",
      "next": "n_fn6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "Don't look like that. I'll always hear the music... even when I can't play.",
      "text_effect": "fade",
      "effect_speed": 0.8,
      "next": "n_fn7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn7",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "crying",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_fn8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn8",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_fn9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "tearful_smile",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_fn10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn10",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The others join us on the roof. Tiffany tells us she recorded the whole performance on her phone.",
      "next": "n_fn11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "I thought... maybe we'd want to remember it. How we sounded together.",
      "next": "n_fn12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Send it to all of us. Every one of us should have it.",
      "next": "n_fn13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn13",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "tearful_smile",
      "text": "So the music doesn't end. Even if we're not together.",
      "next": "n_fn14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn14",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The club ends. Hanami has to step back. The recording lives on — five voices caught in amber, preserved in a moment when everything aligned.",
      "next": "n_fn15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Some songs are written to be played once. And that's what makes them precious.",
      "next": "n_fn16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn16",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_fn17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn17",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_fn18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn18",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_fn19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_fn19",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ending_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_new_harmony_start",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "happy",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_nh2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh2",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany bursts through the rooftop door, breathless. She's holding her phone, and her eyes are wide with disbelief.",
      "next": "n_nh3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "The principal just emailed me. She said... she said...",
      "next": "n_nh4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh4",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "What? What did she say?",
      "next": "n_nh5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "They're giving us another chance! The performance — she said it reminded her why the arts matter. They're restructuring the budget. The club stays!",
      "next": "n_nh6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh6",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "flash",
      "color": "#FFFFFF",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_nh7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh7",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh8",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh10",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "Wait — really?! You're serious?!",
      "next": "n_nh11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "text": "Told you. We're too good to shut down.",
      "next": "n_nh12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "I think I'm going to cry...",
      "next": "n_nh13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh13",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "text": "You're already crying.",
      "next": "n_nh14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh14",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "Happy tears! They're different!",
      "next": "n_nh15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We saved the club. But more importantly, we saved each other. Through every argument, every breakdown, every wrong note — we found our way back.",
      "next": "n_nh16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh16",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dissonance resolved. Not into silence, but into something new.",
      "next": "n_nh17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh17",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh18",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh19",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh20"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh20",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ending_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_echoes_start",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_ec2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ec3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec3",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ec4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec4",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ec5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec5",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One by one, they all find their way up here. We stand together under the stars, the echo of our music still hanging in the air.",
      "next": "n_ec6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "So. This is it, then.",
      "next": "n_ec7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec7",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "A club is just a room. The music is wherever we are.",
      "next": "n_ec8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec8",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "tearful_smile",
      "text": "We'll still practice on weekends, right? Please tell me we'll still practice.",
      "next": "n_ec9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec9",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "text": "Of course. My apartment has thin walls, but I don't think my neighbors will mind.",
      "next": "n_ec10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec10",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "text": "They'll definitely mind.",
      "next": "n_ec11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "Then we'll play louder.",
      "next": "n_ec12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec12",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Everyone laughs. It's soft and a little sad, but it's real.",
      "next": "n_ec13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec13",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We walk out of the school together. The gate closes behind us, and the building goes dark.",
      "next": "n_ec14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec14",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
